%% Flow - git change to published docs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Dev as Engineer Author
  participant GH as GitHub Repo
  participant CI as Actions Generate Pipeline
  participant Det as Change Detector
  participant Gen as Generation CLI
  participant AI as AI Provider
  participant Val as Deterministic Validators
  participant Rev as Reviewer
  participant Build as Build and Deploy
  participant Site as Published Site

  Dev->>GH: push commit or open PR
  GH->>CI: workflow trigger on change
  CI->>Det: run change detection
  Det->>Det: classify changed files by content plane
  Det->>Det: recompute source hashes and compare stored hashes
  Det-->>CI: stale set of affected generated pages
  CI->>Gen: targeted regeneration for stale set only
  Gen->>AI: contract-scoped completion calls
  AI-->>Gen: draft content
  Gen->>Val: parse output and run gates
  Val->>Val: lint - frontmatter schema - links - mermaid compile
  Val-->>Gen: validation report
  Gen->>GH: commit to docs-gen branch and open PR
  GH->>Rev: request review with validation report
  Rev->>GH: approve and merge
  GH->>Build: merge to main triggers build
  Build->>Build: docusaurus build with search index
  Build->>Site: deploy static artifact
  Site-->>Dev: updated docs live
